    "detailed_description": "<strong>**NOTE**</strong><br>This game requires at least 1 controller. It can be played with either 1 controller 1 keyboard, or 2 controllers.<br><br>All of the joy of fireball wars with none of the pesky health in the way!<br><br><strong>Fireball Spam</strong> is a fighting game with two buttons, jump and shoot (give or take). It's one shot-one kill in <strong>Fireball Spam</strong>, so make sure to dodge, intercept, and mind game your opponent to win! Play as 1 of 5 different characters as you fight for fireball supremacy!<br>'<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fast-paced yet tense action<br></li><li> 5 character with different playstyles<br></li><li> Fireballs!<br></li><li> Sometimes not fireballs?<br></li><li> Bombs too!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>**NOTE**</strong><br>This game requires at least 1 controller. It can be played with either 1 controller 1 keyboard, or 2 controllers.<br><br>All of the joy of fireball wars with none of the pesky health in the way!<br><br><strong>Fireball Spam</strong> is a fighting game with two buttons, jump and shoot (give or take). It's one shot-one kill in <strong>Fireball Spam</strong>, so make sure to dodge, intercept, and mind game your opponent to win! Play as 1 of 5 different characters as you fight for fireball supremacy!<br>'<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fast-paced yet tense action<br></li><li> 5 character with different playstyles<br></li><li> Fireballs!<br></li><li> Sometimes not fireballs?<br></li><li> Bombs too!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A two-button, 1 shot, 1 kill fighting game! Taking all of the action of fireball wars in other fighting games and upping the stakes with instantaneous death! No d-pad. No EX-moves, No frills. Just jump, shoot and win!",
